@goodandready/dsh-image-gen README · 🚀 Updates v0.12.9: Full DSH Desktop Electron Compatibility (#478)：- **DSH Desktop Scheme Authorization**: Extended `isTrustedLocalRequest`, `getRouteRejectionStatus`, and `getRouteWriteRejectionStatus` to authorize the privileged `dsh-app://app/` custom scheme from local loopback connections.
- **Desktop Endpoint & Image Unblocking**: Unblocks `/dsh-image-gen/image`, `/dsh-image-gen/approval`, `/dsh-image-gen/vault`, and `/dsh-image-gen/config` from HTTP 403 Forbidden under Electron, restoring thumbnail rendering, Interactive Approval Gate actions, and Studio Vault functionality in DSH Desktop.
- **Fail-Closed Security Invariant**: Untrusted non-loopback LAN origins and spoofed custom schemes (`evil-scheme://`, `dsh-app://untrusted.host`) remain strictly rejected with HTTP 403 Forbidden.

@goodandready/dsh-image-gen README · 🚀 Updates v0.12.8: Interactive Generation Approval Gate (#450)：- **Interactive Approval Gate**: Added interactive confirmation gate before billable image generation calls. Configurable via `requireApproval: boolean` (default `false`) and `approvalTimeoutSec: number` (default `120`, range 5-600) under Settings > Safety.
- **FalApprovalCard Toolview Card**: Renders interactive chat card with prompt, provider, model, dimensions, and estimated USD cost, offering `[🚀 Confirm Generation]` and `[✏️ Modify / Cancel]` actions.
- **Fail-Safe Rollback & Coordination Endpoint**: Zero spend leakage on timeout or user cancellation; coordinated via protected `/dsh-image-gen/approval` endpoint. Supports `approved: true` parameter bypass for explicit confirmed runs.

@goodandready/dsh-image-gen README · 🚀 Updates v0.10.8: Lossless JSON Unification, Dual-Output & Strict Validation (#199)：- **Lossless JSON & Dual-Output Unification**: `upscale_image`, `remove_background`, `blend_images`, and `vectorize_image` now consistently return `toLosslessJson` and formatted markdown `summary` for text-only LLMs.
- **Strict Input Image Validation**: `extract_design_tokens`, `image_to_css_gradient`, and `check_image_contrast` explicitly validate source image readability instead of silent fallback.
- **Unit Testing Suite**: Added `test/tool-consistency.test.mjs` covering tokenization, gradient generator, and PWA suite.

@goodandready/dsh-image-gen README · 🚀 Updates v0.10.22: Referential Stability & React Error #185 Infinite Loop Fix (#230)：* **Settings Card Referential Stability**: Resolved React Error #185 (`Maximum update depth exceeded`) in `FalSettingsCardController` and `CardForm.prototype.bind`. Store snapshots are referentially cached during render cycles (`Object.is(prev, next) === true`), completely preventing infinite re-render loops in React 18 / `useSyncExternalStore`.
* **Deep DSH Store Integration**: Added seamless runtime integration with `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-store` (`runtime.createSnapshotStore`) paired with a robust standalone snapshot caching fallback.
* **Automated Regression Test Suite**: Added dedicated referential identity test in `test/client-syntax.test.mjs` verifying snapshot immutability across repeated reads, single-notification publish triggers, and clean listener lifecycle.

@goodandready/dsh-image-gen README · 🎨 Supported Generation Backends：> [!NOTE]
> **SSRF Protection & Base URLs**: By default, provider endpoints (`baseURL`, `customBaseURL`, `seedreamBaseURL`, `localBaseURL`) are validated against an allowlist of official provider domains and loopback/LAN addresses. To configure custom reverse proxies or third-party gateways, enable **Allow Custom Base URLs** (`allowCustomBaseUrl: true`) in the Provider settings tab.

